Resolve multicast WAN independently of the QinQ replication switch.

Accept a registered standalone NSS Ethernet interface, optionally carrying
one ordinary 802.1Q tag, or a native QinQ DSA port. Ask DSA for the exact
wire representation of the LAN receiver set. Keep unsupported topologies
in Linux rather than constructing a partial NSS replica set.

